d stories of being violated. It was called India\u2019s #MeToo. People who are agitatedly handwringing now, had then asked \u201cwhere\u2019s the proof?\u201d \u201cWhy after years?\u201d \u201cWhy name?\u201d","media":null,"username":"IndiaMeToo","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":285,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":7.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1200987340237225984","date":1575172669000,"rawContent":"Politicians across parties ignored #MeToo, industries went out of the way to make sure the perpetrators are rehabilitated, men and women MRAs asked \u201cWhat about false cases\u201d, media asked \u201chave feminists gone too far\u201d &amp; advised us to introspect. Celebrities were silent.","media":null,"username":"IndiaMeToo","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":286,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":8.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1204008246694096896","date":1575892910000,"rawContent":"UPDATE: This is at 2 pm. #PriyaRamani #MeToo","media":null,"username":"IndiaMeToo","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":287,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":9.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1212218511335944193","date":1577850389000,"rawContent":"Good morning, wishing you all a happy new year. May this year be one of solidarity, intersectionality, empathy, resistan